    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11]\ntheorem green_33 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔\n      ∀ ε : ℝ, 0 < ε →\n        ∃ᶠ q : ℕ+ in atTop,\n          ∃ A : Finset (ZMod q),\n            A + A = Finset.univ ∧\n            |((A.card : ℝ) / Real.sqrt q - Real.sqrt 2)| < ε",
